# Raw diagnostic output from audit runs: greenlet dumps, ryu logs, per-boot stdout,
# controller captures. These are committed on purpose -- the C-1 discipline is that a raw
# backing a published number has to survive, and several conclusions under doc/audit/ are
# only checkable against these files. Deleting them to shrink the diff would destroy the
# evidence base, which is the opposite of the lesson that put them here.
#
# What they should not do is consume review budget. 271 files / ~42k lines sit under these
# paths, and they account for essentially all of this branch's diff growth from ~115k
# insertions (08-21) to ~155k (08-24) -- e.g. a single commit added usr2_attempt4_d2.txt
# (6,328 lines) and usr2_attempt4_d1.txt (3,107).
#
# linguist-generated=true collapses them in GitHub PR diffs and drops them from language
# stats, while leaving them fully readable and diffable locally.
#
# Deliberately NOT `-diff`: that would also suppress the local diff, which would hide an
# accidental edit to files whose whole value is that they are untouched write-once evidence.
# [Co-developed with claude code -- Adam]
doc/audit/**/raw/**        linguist-generated=true

# Same reasoning for the loose raws that predate the raw/ convention.
doc/audit/**/*_ryu.log     linguist-generated=true
doc/audit/**/*.pcap        linguist-generated=true

# Per-run result transcripts. Same reasoning as raw/ above: machine-generated, write-once, and
# they are the evidence a conclusion is checked against -- so they stay in the tree, but they
# should not consume review budget. Added 2026-08-25 after the branch diff reached 184,798
# insertions, of which only 127,721 were reviewable and the rest was captured evidence.
#
# NOTE for anyone measuring: this does NOT change `git diff --stat`. linguist-generated only
# affects GitHub's PR view (collapsed, excluded from language stats). Locally the raw count
# stays high, which is correct -- the lines really are there.
doc/audit/**/*.txt         linguist-generated=true
doc/audit/**/*.tsv         linguist-generated=true
doc/audit/**/*.out         linguist-generated=true
doc/audit/**/*.json        linguist-generated=true
